💡 Most Used in DevOps

1. Remove duplicates        →  Unique IPs, servers, errors
2. Find missing servers     →  expected - running
3. Find common packages     →  server1 & server2
4. Compare environments     →  staging vs production
5. Track unique versions    →  All deployed versions
6. Find extra resources     →  running - expected
